Revolution R Open can work side-by-side with any other version of R on Mac OS X as follows:

Update your system path to reference /usr/local/bin before /usr/bin.

Install R using the Homebrew Package Manager <http://brew.sh/>.

Install Revolution R Open 8.0 using these instructions <http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/rro/installation/>.

Run Revolution R Open by typing one of the following in your terminal:
/usr/bin/R
R

Run R by typing /usr/local/bin/R in your terminal.

Thank you.

